Platform Architecture & Project Integration

Engineering Handoff Specification

Purpose: Define how the individual research projects fit together into a single institutional quantitative research platform.

────────

Executive Summary

This platform is one integrated research ecosystem, not fifteen independent GitHub repositories.

Each subsystem provides a reusable capability that can be leveraged by every research project. The objective is to mirror the architecture of an institutional quantitative research organization.

────────

Platform Philosophy

The platform should demonstrate:

• Systems thinking
• Research rigor
• Production-quality engineering
• Institutional software architecture
• Reusable infrastructure
• AI-native workflows

The codebase should evolve into a cohesive research platform rather than a collection of notebooks.

────────

