Shared Infrastructure

Every subsystem shares:

• Data ingestion
• Feature store
• Experiment tracking
• Backtesting engine
• Risk engine
• Portfolio optimizer
• Reporting
• Configuration
• Testing
• CI/CD

No subsystem should duplicate these capabilities.

