Repository Strategy

Maintain a single flagship repository:

```text
quant-research-platform/
│
├── packages/
│   ├── optimizer/
│   ├── risk/
│   ├── execution/
│   ├── backtester/
│   ├── ml/
│   ├── feature_store/
│   └── ai_agents/
│
├── research/
├── docs/
├── notebooks/
└── infrastructure/
```

Extract individual packages into standalone repositories only if they become independently reusable.

────────

Engineering Philosophy

The engineering specification should describe the platform, while each project specification should describe a subsystem within that platform.

The end result should resemble the internal architecture of a modern systematic hedge fund, where data, research, optimization, execution, risk, and AI are integrated into one cohesive research environment.
